plete:source_review29-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"0m5_mdq_ij2","source_quote":"氐楊馥之聚義眾屯沮水關，城白馬北。集始遣弟集朗率兵迎拒州軍於黃亘，戰大敗。集始走下辯，馥之據武興。虜軍尋退。馥之留弟昌之守武興，自引兵據仇池。詔曰：「氐王楊馥之，世纂忠義，率厲部曲，樹績邊城，克殄姦醜。復內稟朝律，外撫戎荒，款心式昭，朕甚嘉之。以為持節、督北秦雍二州諸軍事、輔國將軍、平羌校尉、北秦州刺史、仇池公。」","reading":"楊馥之、昌之兄弟先據武興、仇池，集始與集朗在敵方。詔授馥之仇池公。","note":"楊馥之、昌之兄弟先據武興、仇池，集始與集朗在敵方。詔授馥之仇池公。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p029","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":158,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:variant_review29-54","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"0m5_mdq_ij2","source_quote":"馥之留弟昌之守武興","reading":"馥之、昌之兄弟分工，集始與弟集朗的抵拒在前。","note":"馥之、昌之兄弟分工，集始與弟集朗的抵拒在前。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p029","start_codepoint":54,"end_codepoint":63,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-qi059-yangfuzhi-brother","subject_person_id":"0m5_mdq_ij2","object_person_id":"ep0_1s5_joh","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"馥之留弟昌之"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-059","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p029","quote":"氐楊馥之聚義眾屯沮水關，城白馬北。集始遣弟集朗率兵迎拒州軍於黃亘，戰大敗。集始走下辯，馥之據武興。虜軍尋退。馥之留弟昌之守武興，自引兵據仇池。詔曰：「氐王楊馥之，世纂忠義，率厲部曲，樹績邊城，克殄姦醜。復內稟朝律，外撫戎荒，款心式昭，朕甚嘉之。以為持節、督北秦雍二州諸軍事、輔國將軍、平羌校尉、北秦州刺史、仇池公。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p029:m0001","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p029:m0058"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"弟守武興。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_pol